# MindPersona local files
# These stay on your machine and are never committed (your saved adjustments live here)

memory/customized-*.md
# A save in progress (left behind only if the server was killed while writing)
memory/.customized-*.tmp
# Held while a save or removal changes a file (left behind only if the server was killed meanwhile)
memory/.customized-*.lock
memory/user-personality.json
.worktrees/
docs/
NEXT_VERSION_ISSUES.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
